              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "The web address **`www.profedcreditunion.com`** belongs to **ProFed Federal Credit Union** (commonly referred to simply as **ProFed Credit Union**). While they own multiple domains, their primary active website is **[profedcu.org](https://profedcu.org)**.\n\n### Overview of ProFed Credit Union:\n* **What It Is:** ProFed is a member-owned, federally insured financial cooperative. \n* **Established:** 1965.\n* **Headquarters:** Fort Wayne, Indiana.\n* **Assets & Scale:** The credit union has grown to manage over $770 million in assets, serving more than 64,500 members across 13 branch locations.\n\n### Eligibility & Membership\nYou are eligible to join ProFed if you live, work, worship, attend school, volunteer, or regularly conduct business in any of the following nine **Northeast Indiana** counties:\n* Adams\n* Allen\n* DeKalb\n* Huntington\n* LaGrange\n* Noble\n* Steuben\n* Wells\n* Whitley\n\n### Services Offered:\n* **Personal Banking:** Checking, savings, and certificate accounts.\n* **Loans:** Auto loans, mortgage loans, and personal credit options.\n* **Cards:** Visa\u00ae rewards cards, debit cards, and specialized card-management features via the ProFedCards app.\n* **Digital Banking:** 24/7 account access, mobile check deposit, and neurodiverse digital accessibility features (such as optimized visual settings for dyslexia, epilepsy, and color blindness).\n* **Financial Planning:** Wealth management and investment options through *ProFed Financial Advisors*.",
